  "title": "Vertiv expands thermal management portfolio with low-GWP offerings in North America",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today announced the North America availability of low-GWP refrigerant versions of its perimeter, row, and wall-mount cooling systems for data centers. These systems are part of Vertiv’s direct expansion (DX) thermal management portfolio and are available more than a year in advance of U.S. EPA requirements taking effect on January 1, 2027. Further, they are fully compliant with current California regulations as well as with impending New York state regulations that take effect in January 2026.",
